# Local configuration overrides. Copy this to sdkconfig.local (that file is gitignored)
# and rebuild: scripts\build-native-win.bat
#
# --- Diagnostics for the crash in AGENTS.md 4.21 ---
# A hardware write watchpoint on the head of NimBLE's connection-parameter update
# entry list. The crash shows up as a read from a garbage address in
# ble_gap_update_next_exp(), i.e. the victim is visible but not the culprit. The
# watchpoint inverts that: the panic fires when the structure is corrupted, with the
#
# THE ADDRESS MUST BE READ FROM YOUR OWN BUILD, because it changes between builds:
#
#   wsl riscv32-esp-elf-nm firmware/build.esp32c3/hid_gamepad_bridge.elf \
#       | grep ble_gap_update_entries
#
# The value below came from one specific build - check it against yours.
#CONFIG_APP_DEBUG_WATCH_ADDR=0x3fc97a24
